          "requirement": "Initialize the notes obstack before assembling a source file.",
          "target_route": "LLVMFuzzerTestOneInput calls read_begin and then perform_an_assembly_pass. The pass creates standard sections through subseg_new; subseg_get allocates section information from notes.",
          "failure_condition": "The old entry bypasses main, where notes is now initialized, and read_begin no longer initializes it. Its first assembly pass therefore allocates from an uninitialized obstack.",
          "alternative_paths": "The complete entry has no call to main or obstack_begin for notes. Its read_begin call no longer supplies that initialization; the fixed source-file argument cannot select another setup route.",
          "discovery_necessary": true,
          "discovery_established": true
        }
      ],
